  "configuration_id": "config_037",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation achieve high performance (0.650 accuracy). Multimodal approaches like config_030 (scvi_n200 + resnet50) underperform, suggesting image modality may not add value without better integration. This experiment tests combining the best RNA encoder (scvi_n200) with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) and weighted fusion, isolating the impact of image quality and fusion strategy. It addresses uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can surpass RNA-only baselines when using superior components."
}

